ic xlink:href="1471-2105-6-S4-S19-4"/></fig><fig position="float" id="F5"><label>Figure 5</label><caption><p>The personal home page of a user after the log in procedure. From this page each user can control the state of advancement of the workflows submitted to the grid platform.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="1471-2105-6-S4-S19-5"/></fig></sec></back></article>